  ---
  Key Points

  - You are billed for full thinking tokens even though Claude 4 returns a summarized version
  - Thinking tokens count toward max_tokens and context window
  - Adds latency — not suitable for real-time apps
  - For Claude 4 models → thinking is summarized before returning
  - For Sonnet 3.7 → full thinking output is returned

